.nh
.TH "PB-ENV-TEAM-REVOKE" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-env-team-revoke - Rotate an ENV team scope and revoke selected members


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb env team revoke  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Rotate an ENV team scope and revoke selected members

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--confirm\fP=""
	exact confirmation phrase for this destructive rotation

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for revoke

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print JSON

.PP
\fB--remove\fP=[]
	account to remove; repeat for multiple accounts

.PP
\fB--total-loss\fP[=false]
	discard the previous team values while rotating the team key


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-env-team(1)\fP
